This game is awesome. The developer managed to create a game with simple and limited mechanics that is SUPER FUN to play. It is impressive how such a simple game can be so good.
+ Pros:
+ Beautiful pixel art;
+ Gundams!
+ Fast-paced-1-shot-death gameplay;
+ Bullet reflection through sword swing at right timing;
+ Balanced, because it is only skill-based;
+ Limited ammo and ally droids forces you to use you sword frequently;
- Cons:
- No online multiplayer (PLEASE CODE THIS, DEVELOPERS! I know fast-paced games usually present problems about online gaming, but the users still need it!);
I certainly recommend this! It is an awesome game and it is definetely better with your couch party friends. It is not so good alone, but it is still pretty fun.

This is not a game;
but a spiritual experience;
about suffering, failure and frustration.
Should you ever be able to finish the game;
you will be able to accept any failures of the past;
and think only about the joy and chances of the present and the future.

Dropzone combines core RTS elements of strategy, map awareness and attention management with key MOBA mechanics like tactical positioning, unique abilities and in-game leveling.
1v1, 2v2, CO-OP & COMPETITIVE MODES and PvE Battles
You play with 3 characters, each one with different roles. You can swap with other characters and find the best combination to play against another players. The goal is killing the Hives to receive a core to then bring to the uplink to earn one point for each uplink you do. There's costumization and loot boxes to increase your arsenal and create a devastating team.
And you get:
- The Squad Edition includes all 12 pilots available at launch;
- Plus an upcoming 5th class with 3 all-new Pilots;
- The Squad Edition comes with all 120 current pieces of gear;
- Plus 24 pieces of gear for the all-new 5th Rig class
ne exclusive Early Access Portrait;
- One exclusive Early Access Vision tower Icon;
- One exclusive Alter Ego: Daredevil Recon - an unique version of our pilot with different costume and alternate gear loadout;
- Unique Pilot Abilities.
Score: 7/10
